# Keep the build context small and reproducible: never ship host node_modules, build output, local
# env, or VCS/CI cruft into an image. Dependencies are installed fresh inside the build stage.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.github
.relay
backups
*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
deploy/compose/.env
